{
    "title": "Morph Mod for Minecraft PE",
    "description": "Morph mod for Minecraft PE allows you to morph into anything!\r\n\r\nMorphing in MCPE is the process of transforming into different mobs and more. By turning into a mob, you receive its characteristics and its skills, which you can use.\r\n\r\nMorph mod application contains the most popular transformation mods and addons, such as Morph Plus, Morph Pack, Morphing Bracelet and Morph into Anything. These and other mods can be downloaded and installed in Minecraft Bedrock Edition and Pocket Edition in a couple of clicks.\r\n\r\nUse the search with hints to quickly find the morph mod you are interested in. It's very simple. After downloading the mod file, run it in the game or open a file manager and install it manually by finding it in the Downloads folder.\r\n\r\nThe morph mod works in Minecraft PE 1.20, 1.19 and older versions. See the description of a specific mod to see which versions are supported.\r\n\r\nTransform into mods such as vampire, mermaids,  enderman, ender dragon, elder guardian, creeper and many others.\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER\r\n\r\nNOT AN OFFICIAL MINECRAFT APP. NOT APPROVED BY OR ASSOCIATED WITH MOJANG OR MICROSOFT.\r\n\r\nThis is an unofficial application for Minecraft Pocket Edition. This application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB. The Minecraft Name, the Minecraft Brand and the Minecraft Assets are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner. All rights reserved. In accordance with http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines",
    "descriptionHTML": "Morph mod for Minecraft PE allows you to morph into anything!<br><br>Morphing in MCPE is the process of transforming into different mobs and more. By turning into a mob, you receive its characteristics and its skills, which you can use.<br><br>Morph mod application contains the most popular transformation mods and addons, such as Morph Plus, Morph Pack, Morphing Bracelet and Morph into Anything. These and other mods can be downloaded and installed in Minecraft Bedrock Edition and Pocket Edition in a couple of clicks.<br><br>Use the search with hints to quickly find the morph mod you are interested in. It&#39;s very simple. After downloading the mod file, run it in the game or open a file manager and install it manually by finding it in the Downloads folder.<br><br>The morph mod works in Minecraft PE 1.20, 1.19 and older versions. See the description of a specific mod to see which versions are supported.<br><br>Transform into mods such as vampire, mermaids,  enderman, ender dragon, elder guardian, creeper and many others.<br><br>DISCLAIMER<br><br>NOT AN OFFICIAL MINECRAFT APP. NOT APPROVED BY OR ASSOCIATED WITH MOJANG OR MICROSOFT.<br><br>This is an unofficial application for Minecraft Pocket Edition. This application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB. The Minecraft Name, the Minecraft Brand and the Minecraft Assets are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner. All rights reserved. In accordance with http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines",
